WEBVTT

00:00:05.250 --> 00:00:08.270
Brother! You ate my candy bar, didn't you?

00:00:08.270 --> 00:00:09.520
Did not!

00:00:09.520 --> 00:00:10.080
That's a lie!

00:00:10.080 --> 00:00:11.450
Is not!

00:00:11.630 --> 00:00:15.080
Now kids, stop fighting.

00:00:16.070 --> 00:00:18.540
I'll teach you a game more fun than that.

00:00:21.120 --> 00:00:23.710
Wow!

00:00:29.630 --> 00:00:30.690
Hey! Wait just a—

00:00:30.700 --> 00:00:31.960
Over here!

00:00:32.020 --> 00:00:34.700
A legend, huh?

00:00:55.640 --> 00:00:59.350
NONSTOP 

00:00:55.640 --> 00:00:59.350
 JUMP STOP

00:01:10.340 --> 00:01:11.030
Next!

00:01:15.880 --> 00:01:16.650
Next!

00:01:19.410 --> 00:01:20.200
Next!

00:01:24.670 --> 00:01:25.860
Rouge!

00:01:25.860 --> 00:01:27.160
Rouge!

00:01:28.580 --> 00:01:29.880
Rouge, you're not moving well!

00:01:29.880 --> 00:01:31.760
What is it, Rouge?

00:01:31.760 --> 00:01:32.510
Next!

00:01:32.510 --> 00:01:33.630
Okay!

00:01:35.370 --> 00:01:38.040
If you don't feel well, you don't have to keep pushing yourself.

00:01:38.040 --> 00:01:39.300
I-I'm fine.

00:01:39.300 --> 00:01:39.950
Next!

00:01:50.850 --> 00:01:52.110
Slash!

00:01:53.510 --> 00:01:55.890
Why are... you here?

00:01:55.890 --> 00:01:57.740
A gift for you, my dear.

00:01:58.490 --> 00:01:59.700
I'm sure you'll find a use for it.

00:01:59.700 --> 00:02:01.150
This...

00:02:06.550 --> 00:02:08.710
Well, well if it isn't the Commissioner.

00:02:08.710 --> 00:02:10.850
What brings you all the way out here?

00:02:10.850 --> 00:02:12.780
Is Eclipse coming along well?

00:02:12.780 --> 00:02:14.470
Yes, of course.

00:02:19.780 --> 00:02:21.210
An invitation.

00:02:22.740 --> 00:02:25.410
To the first OCB league match.

00:02:26.830 --> 00:02:29.360
Huh? What is this?

00:02:29.360 --> 00:02:31.650
"A Change in Dunk Mask's Play..."

00:02:31.650 --> 00:02:36.500
"...caused by the recent match against the idol team Eclipse?" it says...

00:02:37.120 --> 00:02:38.190
Hey, Bel.

00:02:38.190 --> 00:02:40.050
Has Dan changed at all?

00:02:40.050 --> 00:02:41.320
No...

00:02:41.320 --> 00:02:43.250
Just some false rumor, right?

00:02:43.250 --> 00:02:44.840
Maybe...

00:02:45.620 --> 00:02:49.920
"A New Departure for Dan. A Clash of Fate in the Desert."

00:02:49.920 --> 00:02:53.110
This guy has always been frighteningly accurate so far...

00:02:53.110 --> 00:02:55.470
And it seems like he's been trailing Dan a long time.

00:02:56.330 --> 00:02:59.050
Ultimate Bystander, huh?

00:02:59.570 --> 00:03:01.640
What if he's some super stalker?

00:03:10.520 --> 00:03:12.230
Everybody's looking at us.

00:03:12.230 --> 00:03:14.190
It's because of those photos that were spread around.

00:03:14.190 --> 00:03:16.000
No reason to let it bother you now.

00:03:16.000 --> 00:03:18.970
That kiss was setting a trap for all of you...

00:03:20.210 --> 00:03:21.910
I'm your enemy.

00:03:22.380 --> 00:03:24.160
Why are you being nice to me?

00:03:31.180 --> 00:03:33.050
What's so great about him?!

00:03:45.620 --> 00:03:47.610
This is his profile...

00:03:52.610 --> 00:03:54.470
Hey Rouge,

00:03:54.470 --> 00:03:56.790
on tomorrow's schedule, do you know...

00:04:00.170 --> 00:04:01.310
Rouge?

00:04:05.290 --> 00:04:07.620
No. Lower your butt more.

00:04:07.620 --> 00:04:09.120
Don't follow the ball with your eyes.

00:04:09.120 --> 00:04:10.330
Okay, Mr. Dan.

00:04:10.330 --> 00:04:11.890
Don't call me Mr. Dan.

00:04:11.890 --> 00:04:13.470
Sorry, Mr. Dan.

00:04:14.800 --> 00:04:18.860
Good grief. Why do I have to give you a crash course?

00:04:18.860 --> 00:04:22.550
I want to get a little nearer to your level so I can help as a reserve!

00:04:22.550 --> 00:04:26.150
You can get whoever you want to teach you, but it's up to <i>you</i> whether you can do it.

00:04:26.150 --> 00:04:28.710
Didn't someone else teach you, hypocrite?

00:04:28.710 --> 00:04:29.400
Shut your face!

00:04:30.200 --> 00:04:34.150
But if you ask me, with basketball it's really...

00:04:34.150 --> 00:04:36.820
...getting better through just playing.

00:04:44.870 --> 00:04:47.070
You'll get better as you play.

00:04:47.070 --> 00:04:48.310
Shut up!

00:04:54.100 --> 00:04:55.970
The moon person from before...

00:04:57.000 --> 00:04:58.010
Moon?

00:04:59.990 --> 00:05:01.530
It's been a while, Dan.

00:05:01.530 --> 00:05:03.780
Y-You're that jerk who...

00:05:07.140 --> 00:05:08.380
A flying leap!

00:05:14.660 --> 00:05:15.920
Who are you?!

00:05:17.300 --> 00:05:22.030
If either of you can steal the ball from me, I'll tell you.

00:05:22.030 --> 00:05:22.860
What?!

00:05:26.310 --> 00:05:26.830
Outta the way!

00:05:34.460 --> 00:05:35.360
Shit!

00:05:35.360 --> 00:05:36.890
Pitiful!

00:05:36.890 --> 00:05:38.050
Even though it's two-on-one.

00:05:38.050 --> 00:05:41.270
Should I help you out too, Dunk Mask?

00:05:41.270 --> 00:05:43.030
It's you, Idol Red!

00:05:43.030 --> 00:05:44.430
Who the hell asked you to help?

00:05:44.430 --> 00:05:46.570
That's rude! It's Miss Rouge!

00:05:46.570 --> 00:05:48.430
Just concentrate on the game.

00:05:49.280 --> 00:05:51.350
Thank you!

00:05:57.820 --> 00:05:58.820
Shit...

00:06:00.810 --> 00:06:03.990
Why you!

00:06:03.990 --> 00:06:04.950
Move!

00:06:19.820 --> 00:06:21.780
Are you all right, Miss Rouge?!

00:06:22.550 --> 00:06:23.550
I'm fine.

00:06:23.550 --> 00:06:27.000
Hey, you! You run into someone and can't even say a word to apologize?

00:06:27.890 --> 00:06:29.680
S-Sorry about that...

00:06:30.260 --> 00:06:32.370
All right, I swear I'll get it this time!

00:06:51.880 --> 00:06:52.580
Sweat?

00:06:56.080 --> 00:06:57.610
Shit!

00:07:09.040 --> 00:07:10.780
This was over before it started.

00:07:11.960 --> 00:07:13.500
Mr. Dan! Mr. Dan!

00:07:13.500 --> 00:07:14.730
Get a hold of yourself!

00:07:17.150 --> 00:07:19.860
Mr. Dan! Mr. Dan! Mr. Dan!

00:07:19.860 --> 00:07:21.950
Don't call me Mr. Dan!

00:07:22.780 --> 00:07:23.880
Where'd that jerk—!?

00:07:23.880 --> 00:07:25.320
Went home.

00:07:25.320 --> 00:07:26.490
Shit!

00:07:26.490 --> 00:07:29.020
No, more importantly, who was that anyway?

00:07:29.020 --> 00:07:30.160
Slash.

00:07:30.160 --> 00:07:31.430
Sla...?

00:07:31.430 --> 00:07:33.600
There's no one on the moon who doesn't know of Slash.

00:07:33.600 --> 00:07:35.870
Is Slash that remarkable a person, then?

00:07:35.870 --> 00:07:40.180
The OCB Commissioner, James, holds Slash in reserve as his final weapon.

00:07:40.180 --> 00:07:44.380
Despite not yet having officially debuted in the Lunar League, that player is the number one hot topic.

00:07:44.380 --> 00:07:46.240
Who cares about a number one pot topping?!

00:07:46.240 --> 00:07:48.010
It's clobberin' time next time we cross paths!

00:07:48.010 --> 00:07:49.790
So there!

00:07:50.390 --> 00:07:52.350
I'm not interested, okay?

00:07:53.170 --> 00:07:54.570
I want that back after you wash it.

00:07:54.570 --> 00:07:55.790
You better wash it!

00:07:57.160 --> 00:08:00.160
Are you okay now? From getting hurt before?

00:08:00.160 --> 00:08:02.050
None of your business.

00:08:02.700 --> 00:08:03.770
What's that supposed to mean?!

00:08:03.770 --> 00:08:05.690
I'm asking because I'm concerned!

00:08:05.690 --> 00:08:07.310
Oh yeah, what's wrong with <i>you</i>?

00:08:07.310 --> 00:08:08.510
What kind of play was that supposed to be?

00:08:08.510 --> 00:08:09.240
Were you just trying to wing it?

00:08:09.240 --> 00:08:10.630
I don't know!

00:08:10.630 --> 00:08:12.980
I saw I was gonna run into you and then I remembered all this stuff,

00:08:12.980 --> 00:08:14.910
and then some weird monsters showed up!

00:08:14.910 --> 00:08:15.740
Monsters?

00:08:15.740 --> 00:08:17.170
Listen to yourself.

00:08:17.170 --> 00:08:18.670
You aren't some little kid.

00:08:19.360 --> 00:08:20.520
{yells}This is pissing me off!

00:08:20.520 --> 00:08:22.060
I don't want to talk to you!

00:08:22.740 --> 00:08:24.690
Oh, wait, Mr. Dan!

00:08:24.690 --> 00:08:27.670
I'm sorry, Miss Rouge. Excuse us.

00:08:28.260 --> 00:08:30.080
Mr. Dan, wait up!

00:08:30.080 --> 00:08:31.460
Don't call me Mr. Dan!

00:08:31.460 --> 00:08:32.770
Sorry, Mr. Dan!

00:08:34.470 --> 00:08:38.880
Slash? Oh, I may have heard that name before...

00:08:38.880 --> 00:08:42.790
She said it's a famous name on the moon, so I thought maybe you knew something.

00:08:42.790 --> 00:08:45.230
Apparently the Lunar League's most anticipated rookie or something.

00:08:45.230 --> 00:08:49.950
Rookie? This Slash is someone young?

00:08:49.950 --> 00:08:53.280
Yeah. Maybe about the same age as Dan...

00:08:53.280 --> 00:08:55.510
Oh, this is bad.

00:08:56.170 --> 00:08:57.410
What are you doing?

00:08:57.410 --> 00:09:00.100
Finger exercises to keep me from going senile.

00:09:00.100 --> 00:09:04.350
They've been giving me so much trouble lately.

00:09:04.350 --> 00:09:06.170
This one?

00:09:07.740 --> 00:09:09.240
{mmmm sound}How did that one go?

00:09:10.210 --> 00:09:10.920
...What's the deal?

00:09:10.920 --> 00:09:13.340
Alan told us.

00:09:13.340 --> 00:09:15.050
We hear you were acting weird.

00:09:16.810 --> 00:09:18.040
Tell me.

00:09:18.040 --> 00:09:21.970
What did you see on that court? What?

00:09:27.360 --> 00:09:29.100
{yells}Stop it!

00:09:30.610 --> 00:09:32.300
I don't wanna remember!

00:09:37.840 --> 00:09:39.540
Are you all right, Dan?

00:09:39.540 --> 00:09:42.050
I'm fine, just leave me alone!

00:09:43.150 --> 00:09:44.210
Mr. Dan?

00:09:46.080 --> 00:09:47.440
I could hear it.

00:09:48.300 --> 00:09:50.380
The voice of Dan's foot.

00:09:50.380 --> 00:09:51.830
What did it say?

00:09:52.260 --> 00:09:54.520
That it doesn't want to remember.

00:10:05.500 --> 00:10:07.740
You better make sure you give that back.

00:10:07.740 --> 00:10:09.820
Or else I bet she'll never quit nagging.

00:10:10.240 --> 00:10:11.430
Of course I will.

00:10:11.430 --> 00:10:13.540
No way I'm gonna just walk around with something this girlie.

00:10:14.150 --> 00:10:16.430
This isn't good, is it?

00:10:16.430 --> 00:10:19.270
I don't want to admit it, but it's a team crisis.

00:10:19.270 --> 00:10:23.320
Aww. You finally recognized Dan as a teammate.

00:10:24.370 --> 00:10:25.250
What?

00:10:25.330 --> 00:10:28.880
So Dan said he didn't want to remember.

00:10:28.880 --> 00:10:31.590
And something about monsters...

00:10:32.030 --> 00:10:34.790
Then it must be about <i>that</i>, right?

00:10:34.790 --> 00:10:35.960
Probably.

00:10:35.960 --> 00:10:39.200
About what? If you know something, spit it out!

00:10:39.200 --> 00:10:41.550
Well, I mean...

00:10:41.550 --> 00:10:42.770
It probably has to do with Coco.

00:10:44.610 --> 00:10:46.560
After what happened...

00:10:46.560 --> 00:10:48.000
Mine now!

00:10:48.000 --> 00:10:49.660
Just you watch, Coco!

00:10:49.660 --> 00:10:54.150
Your brother's gonna make the most tripped-out, extreme dunk right here, right now!

00:11:04.330 --> 00:11:06.500
You suck so bad!

00:11:12.760 --> 00:11:15.780
It hurts!

00:11:15.810 --> 00:11:17.180
Coco!

00:11:17.850 --> 00:11:21.020
What about her legs? When are they gonna heal, huh?!

00:11:21.020 --> 00:11:23.780
We can reassemble the shattered bones.

00:11:23.780 --> 00:11:27.710
But there's nothing we can do about the shredded nerves.

00:11:27.710 --> 00:11:30.120
Nothing... You mean...

00:11:30.120 --> 00:11:31.910
I mean it's no use hoping.

00:11:31.910 --> 00:11:34.460
No use?! You call yourself a doctor?!

00:11:34.460 --> 00:11:36.120
You better do something, and do it now!

00:11:36.120 --> 00:11:37.000
Coco...

00:11:37.000 --> 00:11:37.970
Coco, you know...

00:11:37.970 --> 00:11:39.600
She's way better than me at basketball,

00:11:39.600 --> 00:11:40.970
and she's way cooler than me,

00:11:40.970 --> 00:11:42.990
and compared to me... to some punk like me...

00:11:42.990 --> 00:11:46.080
she's got such a brilliant future as a player!

00:11:47.500 --> 00:11:48.840
Please...

00:11:49.620 --> 00:11:50.930
Please!

00:11:51.880 --> 00:11:54.420
Don't take basketball away from her...

00:11:56.940 --> 00:12:00.750
Ever since, Dan's thrown himself into basketball twice as hard as your average person.

00:12:02.510 --> 00:12:08.410
Maybe Dan runs so hard when he plays because he wants to run away from the past.

00:12:10.840 --> 00:12:12.110
Miss Sela?

00:12:12.110 --> 00:12:14.030
What's wrong with Sela?

00:12:14.030 --> 00:12:15.450
I don't know...

00:12:15.450 --> 00:12:19.070
But just now I felt a manas of terrible sadness.

00:12:21.100 --> 00:12:23.330
"The man of legend, hitting rock bottom!"

00:12:23.330 --> 00:12:25.340
"Can his team survive?"

00:12:49.640 --> 00:12:50.990
You!

00:12:50.990 --> 00:12:52.310
How'd you find this place?

00:12:52.310 --> 00:12:53.960
I have a keen nose.

00:12:53.960 --> 00:12:54.940
Admit defeat!

00:12:56.780 --> 00:12:58.330
Who is it?

00:12:58.330 --> 00:13:00.280
Oh, no one!

00:13:01.840 --> 00:13:04.590
Dan did sorta wash it with his dirty hands.

00:13:05.870 --> 00:13:06.950
It's dirty!

00:13:08.220 --> 00:13:09.960
There. You got it back.

00:13:09.960 --> 00:13:11.790
It's all damp...

00:13:11.790 --> 00:13:13.460
Oh, crap!

00:13:24.830 --> 00:13:25.870
Where's Rouge?

00:13:25.870 --> 00:13:26.720
{overlap}The bath.

00:13:25.870 --> 00:13:26.720
{overlap}The toilet.

00:13:29.060 --> 00:13:31.870
Well, here's an invitation to a league match.

00:13:31.870 --> 00:13:34.840
Training camp starts next week, so please be prepared.

00:13:34.840 --> 00:13:37.240
Hey! Keep your hands to yourself!

00:13:37.240 --> 00:13:38.980
This place is tiny, I can't help it!

00:13:38.980 --> 00:13:40.650
Just be quiet, please!

00:13:40.650 --> 00:13:42.940
Jan told me not to meet with you!

00:13:42.940 --> 00:13:44.640
Well you didn't have to hide in here too!

00:13:44.640 --> 00:13:47.780
I pushed you in and got caught in the moment!

00:13:53.460 --> 00:13:55.290
Don't forget I'm here too.

00:13:57.190 --> 00:13:59.460
So what're league matches anyway?

00:13:59.460 --> 00:14:01.450
Ones hosted by the OCB.

00:14:02.950 --> 00:14:04.310
You aren't gonna participate?

00:14:04.310 --> 00:14:06.470
Couldn't care less.

00:14:06.470 --> 00:14:08.680
Well, you couldn't anyway.

00:14:08.680 --> 00:14:09.700
What?!

00:14:09.700 --> 00:14:13.610
No way you could take part in matches with some trauma hanging over you.

00:14:14.980 --> 00:14:16.510
Bullseye, right?

00:14:16.510 --> 00:14:18.880
That's called trauma?

00:14:19.550 --> 00:14:21.650
Thought so. Woman's intuition.

00:14:22.100 --> 00:14:24.030
Women are amazing.

00:14:24.030 --> 00:14:25.540
Women are scary.

00:14:25.540 --> 00:14:29.140
If you entered a match with your current skills, you'd be crushed.

00:14:29.140 --> 00:14:30.990
Yeah right, stupid! No way!

00:14:30.990 --> 00:14:34.040
Oh really? Wanna try going against me again?

00:14:34.040 --> 00:14:35.620
You're on!

00:14:35.620 --> 00:14:37.810
I'll pound into you how much better I am. {lit, I'll show you the difference between our abilities.}

00:14:37.810 --> 00:14:39.570
That's my line!

00:14:41.700 --> 00:14:43.390
Jan left.

00:14:43.390 --> 00:14:45.690
Oh, did we interrupt?

00:14:45.690 --> 00:14:47.240
Not at all!

00:14:47.240 --> 00:14:48.140
In unison!

00:14:48.140 --> 00:14:49.810
Yep! They're totally in love!

00:14:49.810 --> 00:14:52.000
I said it's not like that!

00:14:52.000 --> 00:14:52.990
Don't copy me!

00:14:52.990 --> 00:14:53.350
What?!

00:14:54.950 --> 00:14:56.850
Hey, don't just toss your stuff around!

00:14:56.850 --> 00:14:57.560
Shut up!

00:14:58.890 --> 00:15:00.260
Oh, Rouge...

00:15:00.260 --> 00:15:02.650
Man, I'm jealous.

00:15:02.650 --> 00:15:05.150
I want to be all lovey-dovey with someone too!

00:15:09.860 --> 00:15:11.740
It's all going as planned.

00:15:12.180 --> 00:15:15.330
Just watch, I'll pull it off in time for the league match, James.

00:15:15.780 --> 00:15:19.430
It's unusual for you to get so involved.

00:15:19.430 --> 00:15:20.980
Any reasons?

00:15:20.980 --> 00:15:22.770
No, not really.

00:15:24.090 --> 00:15:26.610
A legend, huh?

00:15:26.610 --> 00:15:29.140
Just winning isn't enough.

00:15:29.840 --> 00:15:32.940
If you're going to do something, you should make it as interesting as you can.

00:15:35.810 --> 00:15:37.850
Bigfoots would stand out too much.

00:15:37.850 --> 00:15:40.560
You're okay with normal one-on-one basketball, right?

00:15:40.560 --> 00:15:42.900
The kind doesn't matter, I'm still gonna win!

00:15:54.790 --> 00:15:58.120
I need to see Dan's problems with my own eyes.

00:15:58.120 --> 00:15:59.620
Go Dan!

00:16:10.080 --> 00:16:11.300
Not going to happen!

00:16:21.820 --> 00:16:22.650
Shit!

00:16:28.130 --> 00:16:29.230
Shit!

00:16:29.230 --> 00:16:30.910
How about trying to use your head more?

00:16:30.910 --> 00:16:33.210
Just running doesn't get you anywhere.

00:16:33.210 --> 00:16:34.250
Shut up!

00:16:35.330 --> 00:16:37.600
He's getting his ass handed to him.{sz: lol this is a bit strong for the JP but it fits her tone so well.}

00:16:37.600 --> 00:16:39.570
Come back stronger!

00:16:39.570 --> 00:16:41.040
Dan! Keep cool!

00:16:43.170 --> 00:16:46.280
Wanting to run from your past, huh?

00:16:55.820 --> 00:16:56.520
Gotcha!

00:16:59.940 --> 00:17:02.700
You think you can beat me like that?

00:17:02.700 --> 00:17:06.240
Out of his mech, Dunk Mask is nothing special! How sad!

00:17:06.240 --> 00:17:07.400
I'm just getting started!

00:17:07.400 --> 00:17:12.040
At this rate I'm gonna win with double—no, triple your score.

00:17:12.040 --> 00:17:14.200
It's boring winning so easily!

00:17:15.920 --> 00:17:17.790
You're gonna eat those words.

00:17:17.790 --> 00:17:22.120
Dan has completely lost sight of his own play.

00:17:22.120 --> 00:17:24.540
This is where you show what you're made of, Dan. {alt tl: This is where you dig in and hold on, Dan.}

00:17:27.050 --> 00:17:28.510
What the hell...

00:17:31.680 --> 00:17:33.570
Shit, shit, shit!

00:17:40.520 --> 00:17:42.710
Hey, isn't that Dunk Mask?

00:17:42.710 --> 00:17:45.400
He's playing Rouge from Eclipse!

00:17:48.270 --> 00:17:49.670
You okay?

00:17:49.670 --> 00:17:51.070
You're all pale.

00:17:51.070 --> 00:17:51.700
Shut up.

00:17:58.850 --> 00:17:59.790
Ow!

00:17:59.790 --> 00:18:01.910
Oww! I'm gonna die!

00:18:01.910 --> 00:18:04.040
Die, die, die!

00:18:06.330 --> 00:18:08.700
Come on, get a grip...

00:18:17.890 --> 00:18:21.160
Just stop it, please!

00:18:37.700 --> 00:18:38.200
Rouge!

00:18:41.530 --> 00:18:42.430
Rouge!

00:18:43.030 --> 00:18:43.990
Now!

00:18:45.100 --> 00:18:46.120
A three-pointer!

00:19:07.180 --> 00:19:09.440
There, you finally got some points.

00:19:14.090 --> 00:19:17.710
Good job, Dan!

00:19:23.290 --> 00:19:26.580
Did I imagine them?

00:19:27.280 --> 00:19:31.640
You're already dumb, and I bet you were thinking about a bunch of useless stuff.

00:19:31.640 --> 00:19:33.590
You like to go just one line too far!

00:19:33.590 --> 00:19:35.340
You can't play without rhythm.

00:19:35.340 --> 00:19:39.510
Even in music, it gets hard to listen to a fast tempo all the time, right?

00:19:39.510 --> 00:19:45.180
It's the silent places tucked in that make a rhythm stand out and give you a good song.

00:19:46.130 --> 00:19:48.610
It's the same with basketball. Get it?

00:19:49.930 --> 00:19:51.300
No...

00:19:51.300 --> 00:19:53.420
Stuff like that's beyond you if you can't read music.

00:19:53.420 --> 00:19:54.070
What?!

00:19:54.070 --> 00:19:57.920
Oh, you know how? Do-re-mi-fa-so-la-ti!

00:19:57.920 --> 00:19:59.380
Don't make fun of me!

00:19:59.380 --> 00:20:02.710
Anyway, the basic idea is, sometimes you should stand still!

00:20:03.600 --> 00:20:05.170
Why you...

00:20:05.170 --> 00:20:09.540
That's right. Our game isn't over yet, Idol Red!

00:20:12.710 --> 00:20:14.090
Game set.

00:20:17.400 --> 00:20:20.160
"Signs of resurrection for the man of legend."

00:20:20.160 --> 00:20:22.970
"His participation in the OCB league match a possibility?"

00:20:24.190 --> 00:20:25.210
I see.

00:20:25.650 --> 00:20:28.170
Dan has made it out of a long tunnel.

00:20:28.820 --> 00:20:32.700
But why did you tell me about the accident?

00:20:32.700 --> 00:20:35.480
Isn't that part of the past you don't want to remember?

00:20:36.690 --> 00:20:39.800
Was it all for Dan's sake?

00:20:41.320 --> 00:20:42.770
At any rate, I thank you.

00:20:43.200 --> 00:20:46.320
You should make sure to come to the OCB league match.

00:20:46.320 --> 00:20:47.450
If I feel like it.

00:20:50.240 --> 00:20:53.240
Do you... think you'll ever play?

00:20:53.650 --> 00:20:56.250
Even wheelchair-bound, you could handle a Bigfoot.

00:21:06.140 --> 00:21:09.480
This is my Basquash.

00:21:14.390 --> 00:21:16.190
This is hard on you too.

00:21:16.190 --> 00:21:17.940
These are seeds I sowed myself.

00:21:17.940 --> 00:21:20.440
Yeah. I hope they grow tall.

00:21:20.440 --> 00:21:22.870
Next time: In the Night Before.

00:21:20.440 --> 00:21:27.900
NEXT TIME

00:21:21.360 --> 00:21:27.900
IN

00:21:21.610 --> 00:21:27.900
THE

00:21:21.780 --> 00:21:27.900
NIGHT

00:21:22.030 --> 00:21:27.900
BEFORE

00:21:23.290 --> 00:21:24.640
It's nearly time.

00:21:24.640 --> 00:21:26.680
I'm looking forward to that league match.
